  "steps": [
    "Begin in a high plank with palms under or just outside the shoulders; fingers spread and elbows softly extended.",
    "Lower the chest as one unit, keeping the pelvis from sagging and the neck neutral.",
    "Track the elbows back and out at a controlled angle (roughly 30–60° from the torso rather than straight sideways).",
    "Stop just above the floor without collapsing the shoulders, then press the floor away to return to a stable plank."
  ],
